---
const webPath = '/capability-statement/';
---

<section id="leadership" class="py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Leadership & Capability Statement</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 section-subheading">
        Atelier Logic Group LLC is led by a principal investigator with decades of enterprise AI, optimization, and aerospace systems experience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      {/* Bio Card */}
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-400/10 bg-slate-800/30 p-6 sm:p-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start gap-5">
          <div class="flex h-20 w-20 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-gold to-gold-600 text-navy text-2xl font-black shadow-lg shadow-gold/20">
            IA
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cream">Ishmael Ibrahim Amin, M.S.</h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-gold">Principal Investigator & Founder</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
              Ishmael Ibrahim Amin, M.S., has spent 30+ years in enterprise technology, AI leadership, and systems engineering since starting his IT career in 1996. A Northwestern M.S. in Data Science in Artificial Intelligence and former leader of DXC Technology’s 10,000-member global AI Guild, he has supervised 40+ data scientists, engineers, and ETL DBAs while delivering production systems for Fortune 500 aviation, banking, and rail clients. He brings foundational enterprise architecture experience (C# / ASP.NET / QAD ERP) together with modern Python, PySpark, Databricks, and Agentic AI platform leadership. He leverages rapid AI-augmented tooling (Cursor, MCP) to audit, interface with, and modernize legacy enterprise C# / .NET codebases. His MILP optimization engines have unlocked an estimated $20M–$40M in operational savings for global aviation networks, and his public-sector data work contributed to a $141.3M grant win for the City of New Orleans.
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
                M.S. in Data Science in Artificial Intelligence — Northwestern University
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
                B.S. in Statistical Science — University of California, Santa Barbara
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
                Databricks Certified Generative AI Engineer Associate (2024)
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
                Microsoft Azure AI Fundamentals (AI-900) & Azure Fundamentals (AZ-900)
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
                30+ years enterprise technology & AI leadership (career started 1996)
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
                Former leader of DXC Technology’s 10,000-member global AI Guild
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
                Supervised 40+ data scientists, engineers, and ETL DBAs
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
                $20M–$40M MILP aviation optimization savings track record
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold" aria-hidden="true" />
                $141.3M public-sector grant win (City of New Orleans data repository)
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold mt-1.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
                Strategic Academic Testing & Hardware Validation Partnerships (e.g., LSU aiR Lab for physical embedded SWaP-C HIL testing)
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Capability Statement Card */}
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gold/20 bg-gold/5 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gold/15 text-gold">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" />
              <path d="M14 2v6h6" />
              <path d="M16 13H8" />
              <path d="M16 17H8" />
              <path d="M10 9H8" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-bold text-cream">Official 1-Page Capability Statement</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
            View the web-based capability statement or download the official PDF for defense primes, federal health IT buyers, SBLOs, and contracting officers. Includes UEI, CAGE, NAICS, PSC, core capabilities, and IP status.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a
            href={webPath}
            class="btn-secondary w-full sm:w-auto justify-center"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6" />
              <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9" />
              <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3" />
            </svg>
            View Web Version
          </a>
          <button
            onclick="window.print()"
            class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto justify-center"
          >
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 15V3" />
              <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4" />
              <path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5" />
            </svg>
            Print / Save as PDF
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      {/* Executive Endorsements & Social Proof */}
      <div class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-2 mt-4 space-y-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-cream border-b border-slate-700 pb-2">Executive Endorsements & Social Proof</h3>
        
        {/* Testimonials Grid */}
        <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
          {/* Card 1: Joshi Dattaraj */}
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-400/20 bg-slate-800/40 p-6 relative">
            <svg class="absolute top-4 right-4 h-8 w-8 text-slate-600/30" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M9.352 4C4.456 7.456 1 13.12 1 19.36c0 5.088 3.072 8.064 6.624 8.064 3.36 0 5.856-2.688 5.856-5.856 0-3.168-2.208-5.472-5.088-5.472-.576 0-1.344.096-1.536.192.48-3.264 3.552-7.104 6.624-9.024L9.352 4zm16.512 0c-4.8 3.456-8.256 9.12-8.256 15.36 0 5.088 3.072 8.064 6.624 8.064 3.264 0 5.856-2.688 5.856-5.856 0-3.168-2.304-5.472-5.184-5.472-.576 0-1.248.096-1.44.192.48-3.264 3.456-7.104 6.528-9.024L25.864 4z" />
            </svg>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 italic relative z-10">
              "Ishmael designed and deployed scalable machine learning solutions. He led advanced co-investment projects with one of our largest clients, delivering results in Data Science, large language models (LLMs), and enterprise AI architecture. He consistently turned complex business challenges into actionable strategies that produced measurable outcomes."
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-bold text-cream">Joshi Dattaraj</p>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gold mt-0.5">Senior Manager & Direct Supervisor, DXC Technology</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          {/* Card 2: Daniele Passarelli */}
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-400/20 bg-slate-800/40 p-6 relative">
            <svg class="absolute top-4 right-4 h-8 w-8 text-slate-600/30" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M9.352 4C4.456 7.456 1 13.12 1 19.36c0 5.088 3.072 8.064 6.624 8.064 3.36 0 5.856-2.688 5.856-5.856 0-3.168-2.208-5.472-5.088-5.472-.576 0-1.344.096-1.536.192.48-3.264 3.552-7.104 6.624-9.024L9.352 4zm16.512 0c-4.8 3.456-8.256 9.12-8.256 15.36 0 5.088 3.072 8.064 6.624 8.064 3.264 0 5.856-2.688 5.856-5.856 0-3.168-2.304-5.472-5.184-5.472-.576 0-1.248.096-1.44.192.48-3.264 3.456-7.104 6.528-9.024L25.864 4z" />
            </svg>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300 italic relative z-10">
              "Ishmael was instrumental in establishing and leading the global AI Engineering Guild, creating a vibrant, cross-functional community that promoted knowledge sharing and professional development. The guild became an exemplar within the organization... Ishmael brings a rare combination of technical depth, strategic vision, and a collaborative mindset."
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4">
              <p class="text-sm font-bold text-cream">Daniele Passarelli</p>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gold mt-0.5">Software Engineering Director, Head of CES Chapters & Guilds, DXC Luxoft</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        {/* Civic Innovation & Grant Badge */}
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-gold/30 bg-gold/10 p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-start sm:items-center">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-gold/20 p-3 rounded-full">
            <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">🏆</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-cream">LSU New Orleans Disaster Recovery Hackathon Winner ($5,000 Grant)</h4>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
              Co-creator of <em class="text-gold font-medium">DAC</em> (Disaster Assistant Consultant) prototype assisting natural disaster survivors with FEMA and insurance claims. Voluntarily passed the $5,000 grant prize to high school and Operation Spark students for community empowerment.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
              — Verified by <span class="text-slate-300">Christian Holdsworth</span>, <span class="italic">Associate Manager, Sales, DXC Technology</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
